    "body": "## Summary\n\n- add `.sha256` sidecar generation for Fastlane-staged Android APK and AAB artifacts\n- cover the Android Fastlane staging path in release automation tests\n- document that Fastlane creates Android checksum sidecars\n\n## Why\n\nThe Fastlane release flow staged Android artifacts without the `.sha256` files expected by the release process. The checksum now hashes the final staged artifact bytes and writes the standard `<digest>  <basename>` format so `shasum -a 256 -c` works from the artifact directory.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `just test-release-scripts`\n- `just release-build-android-staging`\n- `just release-build-android-production`\n- `shasum -a 256 -c *.sha256` in both staged Android release directories\n\n<!-- stage-review-badge-begin -->\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://stagereview.app/marmot-protocol/whitenoise/pull/634\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://stagereview.app/assets/gh-open-in-stage-dark.svg\">\n    <img src=\"https://stagereview.app/assets/gh-open-in-stage-light.svg\" alt=\"Open in Stage\">\n  </picture>\n</a>\n\n<!-- stage-review-badge-end -->",
