    "body": "## Summary\n- Hide invites, chat previews, message timelines, and search results from blocked users\n- Suppress blocked senders from new chat updates and notifications\n- Refresh block state from the Rust mute list so the UI stays in sync after block and unblock actions\n- Exclude `widgetbook/**` from the root analyzer so Widgetbook is checked in its own package context\n\n## Testing\n- Added and updated unit and widget tests for chat list, chat screen, invite flow, message search, chat list search, and notification handling\n- Ran `just generate`\n- Ran `flutter analyze --fatal-infos` for the root app and for `widgetbook`\n- Ran `just precommit` successfully\n\n<!-- stage-review-badge-begin -->\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://stagereview.app/marmot-protocol/whitenoise/pull/623\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://stagereview.app/assets/gh-open-in-stage-dark.svg\">\n    <img src=\"https://stagereview.app/assets/gh-open-in-stage-light.svg\" alt=\"Open in Stage\">\n  </picture>\n</a>\n\n<!-- stage-review-badge-end -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * App-wide blocking: block/unblock now hides blocked users across chats, messages, searches, invites, and notifications; blocked invites are auto-redirected/hidden and unread/preview counts are sanitized.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Analyzer configuration updated and minor dependency revision applied.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * Extensive tests added/updated covering blocking, filtering, invites, notifications, chat summary, message/search filtering, and related UI flows.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
