    "body": "<!--\r\n  Thanks for contributing!\r\n\r\n  Provide a description of your changes below and a general summary in the title\r\n\r\n  Please look at the following checklist to ensure that your PR can be accepted quickly:\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## Description\r\n\r\nCloses #421 Allows to save in gallery images and videos from the media modal with long press or with the download button. \r\n\r\n⚠️ 🎨 At first I was showing the success feedback as a system notice in the media modal, but as it used space above the image, it reduced the space available and forced the image to change size, which caused a visual \"jump\" of the image. So I added a check in the same download button cause the success, which feels to me more subtle. For the error case I kept the system notice. \r\n\r\n<!--\r\nDescribe what changed and why. Link the related issue: `Closes #NNN`\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## Type of Change\r\n\r\n- [x] ✨ New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\r\n- [ ] 🛠️ Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\r\n- [ ] ❌ Breaking change (fix or feature that would cause existing functionality to change)\r\n- [ ] 🧹 Code refactor\r\n- [ ] ✅ Build configuration change\r\n- [ ] 📝 Documentation\r\n- [ ] 🗑️ Chore\r\n- [ ] 🧪 Tests\r\n\r\n## How I Tested This\r\n\r\n<!-- Describe what you ran or manually verified and include device/OS/simulator details. -->\r\n\r\n- Checked that download does not turn back to first index \r\n- Check that images and videos are actually saved in gallery\r\n- Check that when video is playing, the download button hides\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e669d277-e0fa-4938-a673-3b106ec8fbb0\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] `just precommit` passes\r\n- [ ] Related issue linked (`Closes #NNN`)\r\n- [X] `CHANGELOG.md` updated (if user-visible change)\r\n- [ ] Screenshots added (for UI changes)\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- stage-review-badge-begin -->\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://stagereview.app/marmot-protocol/whitenoise/pull/619\">\r\n  <picture>\r\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://stagereview.app/assets/gh-open-in-stage-dark.svg\">\r\n    <img src=\"https://stagereview.app/assets/gh-open-in-stage-light.svg\" alt=\"Open in Stage\">\r\n  </picture>\r\n</a>\r\n\r\n<!-- stage-review-badge-end -->\r\n\r\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\r\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\r\n\r\n* **New Features**\r\n  * Save-to-gallery for images/videos with UI download control, overlay support on media players/previews, and inline system notices for failures and brief “saved” confirmation.\r\n\r\n* **Localization**\r\n  * Added save-to-gallery error messages in English, German, Spanish, French, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, and Turkish.\r\n\r\n* **Chores**\r\n  * Updated platform manifest/permission entries for gallery access (Android/iOS) and added gallery-handling dependency.\r\n\r\n* **Tests**\r\n  * Expanded test coverage for save flows, overlays, and aspect-ratio parsing.\r\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
