    "body": "<!--\r\n  Thanks for contributing!\r\n\r\n  Provide a description of your changes below and a general summary in the title\r\n\r\n  Please look at the following checklist to ensure that your PR can be accepted quickly:\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## Description\r\nTiny spacing fix that gave me OCD when I noticed: the spacing between search input in chats and archive was not the same. In small screens this ended up looking bad.\r\n\r\nThis PR exposes a method in the search field to get its exact height. And then uses it in the chatlist to fix the issue\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nDescribe what changed and why. Link the related issue: `Closes #NNN`\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## Type of Change\r\n\r\n- [ ] ✨ New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\r\n- [X] 🛠️ Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\r\n- [ ] ❌ Breaking change (fix or feature that would cause existing functionality to change)\r\n- [ ] 🧹 Code refactor\r\n- [ ] ✅ Build configuration change\r\n- [ ] 📝 Documentation\r\n- [ ] 🗑️ Chore\r\n- [ ] 🧪 Tests\r\n\r\n## How I Tested This\r\n\r\nI tested this in my both iphones (11 and 6)  and it now loosk good. What I did\r\n- Entered the chat list\r\n- Switchet to archive\r\n- Checked that the distance between search input and filter chips didn't change\r\n- In archive view, swipe up to hide search input\r\n- Check that there is still enough space above for the filter chips. \r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n\r\n**iPhone 6**\r\n\r\n|🐛 Before |👍🏻 After|\r\n|----|----|\r\n|<img width=\"300\" alt=\"before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8bfc6cd-0a1c-482a-b398-60ba87643b4d\" />|<img width=\"300\"  alt=\"after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fac2f96f-f753-46e7-a6ce-b996d8c43bb5\" />|\r\n\r\n\r\n** 🐛 Before in iPhone 11:**\r\nWhen switching from chat to archive, the spacing between search input and pills changes. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc823618-d74a-4b79-b2fa-a880e7d7fbb7\r\n\r\n** 👍🏻 Fixed in iPhone 11:**\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70558497-d1ca-417e-b2bb-6e5875bd60a1\r\n\r\n\r\n1\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] `just precommit` passes\r\n- [ ] Related issue linked (`Closes #NNN`)\r\n- [x] `CHANGELOG.md` updated (if user-visible change)\r\n- [x] Screenshots added (for UI changes)\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\r\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\r\n\r\n* **Improvements**\r\n  * Search field height now adapts dynamically for more consistent layout across devices.\r\n  * Refined chat list spacing and pinned-header behavior, improving header positioning, archived view layout, and empty-state placement.\r\n* **Chore**\r\n  * Release notes updated to include an additional linked PR.\r\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
